# Blue Sharc: .sharc/ is a mix of machine-local runtime caches (cracked
# substrate .rac files, peer/provider configs with this machine's absolute
# install path, session logs) and derived files (state.json/tree.json/
# governance.json, 100% rebuilt from evolution/manifest.toml by tree.build on
# every pull/merge/checkout via the post-merge/post-checkout hook). None of
# that is shareable or should ever be hand-edited or committed -- only the
# Goal/Epic/Feature/Story source of truth is.
.sharc/*
!.sharc/evolution
.sharc/evolution/*
!.sharc/evolution/manifest.toml
